      "id": "policy-actions",
      "title": "Policy Actions for Sustained Growth",
      "objective": "Summarize the global and domestic reform agenda — improving trade environments, easing financing, mitigating climate risks, diversifying trade, and removing structural bottlenecks."
    },
    {
      "id": "strategic-priorities",
