      "objective": "Present the Bank's flagship targets: health services, electricity access, agricultural value chains, women's capital access, and water security."
    },
    {
      "id": "research-themes",
      "title": "Key Research Themes in Recent Issues",
      "objective": "Provide a snapshot of the analytical depth behind the report, covering fiscal policy, trade costs, commodity cycles, and pandemic economics."
